**Read:** [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](../sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), all aluminium extraction and molten-salt model material; [Principles of Extractive Metallurgy — Tarun Kumar Kundu, NPTEL](../sources/Principles-of-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_7VCNEHN5VCQDDQTZ512PSHFZ78), the complete electrometallurgical and furnace/energy sequence; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), the full aluminium, anode/electrode, gas, utility, and residual chapters.

Alumina dissolution and reduction in a salt bath join metal/electrolyte interfaces, carbon or other electrode behavior, gas generation, current distribution, heat, containment, and product handling. The bath's composition and properties, feed quality, geometry, and operating history affect performance together.

For a deliberately simplified carbon-anode overall reaction, 2Al₂O₃ + 3C → 4Al + 3CO₂. Check atom and electron accounts before comparing charge, carbon, gas, and energy quantities. Actual side reactions, nonuniform conditions, current efficiency, electrode loss, bath constituents, and captured/recycled material require their own evidence.

Distinguish reversible electrical work, thermoneutral heat, measured cell input, broader smelter utilities, and accepted-metal output. An electrode or voltage improvement can alter thermal balance, lifetime, feed response, or maintenance. Claims about alternative electrodes require actual materials, reaction, product, and scale evidence.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete published cell/smelter account from full technical methods. Independently calculate target/impurity, charge, electrode/gas, and energy/heat balances with uncertainty. Compare a documented alternative or changed feed/electrical condition, retaining containment, capture, maintenance, and quality consequences. Explain the independent observations needed to distinguish a true process improvement from a shifted system boundary or unmeasured loss.

**Continue:** [Connect aluminium quality with alloy constitution, fabrication, and scrap history](Aluminium-cast-wrought-and-recycled-product-pathways.lingua#r_4E4KG131W9P8N9AS7SS3JBTTNX).

